/target
/graphify-out
/dist

# Recordings and capture output land in the working directory.
*.mkv
*.mp4
*.png
# sound.rs renders cues to WAV when auditioning them, and those land wherever
# the tool that asked for them was pointed. Three of them reached the repo root.
*.wav

# Source assets are checked in explicitly: the logo is compiled into the client
# binary with include_bytes!, so a clone without it does not build. Excluding
# the whole directory keeps this from breaking each time an asset is added.
!/assets/**

# These are published website assets, not local diagnostic captures.
!/website/screenshots/*.png

# Real app screenshots used by the README, not local diagnostic captures.
!/docs/screenshots/*.png
